  "articleBody": "A successful kitchen lighting upgrade combines layered illumination, suitable controls, and electrical planning rather than relying on one bright ceiling fixture. For a San Diego County remodel, review cabinet and ceiling conditions, choose task lighting for work surfaces, coordinate decorative fixtures with the layout, and confirm whether rewiring or new circuits require permitting before construction begins.",
